00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:43.900
Migrate for Anthos uses the
[? MQCTL ?] command line

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.930
interface to define the
source and the destination

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:50.660
of the migration and to kick
off the migration process.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.330
As you can see
here, I've already

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:56.500
set up the VMware environment
as the source of the migration.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.820
To begin the migration of
the legacy CRM application,

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:03.310
I first create a migration plan
using the [? MQCTL ?] command

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:04.660
line interface.

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:07.600
The migration plan will provide
details such as the VMware

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.660
