00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.230
Migrate for Anthos
is able to determine

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:19.180
what files from
the virtual machine

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:21.520
are needed to produce
a containerized image

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.350
