00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:26.230
I only need it to specify the
directories that should not

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:29.890
be included in the migration
and the directories that

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:32.170
contain data that
should be persisted

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:34.150
to a persistent volume.

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:36.160
When I finish running
this migration plan

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:38.770
