00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.900
I can download these
artifacts to my Cloud

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:49.300
Shell or local machine.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.490
These artifacts
include a Docker file

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:53.740
to update my source
application's container

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:58.060
