00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:18.940
image that contains a replica
of the source virtual machine.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:22.150
I can also make updates to
packages in the container

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.280
and can upgrade the
Migrate for Anthos runtime

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:27.190
in the future for new
releases or bug fixes.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:29.320
I can make changes
to this Docker file

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:31.570
as I would to any
other Docker file.

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:33.760
I make the changes,
rebuild the image,

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.470
and push to a
container registry,

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:38.390
