private Container Registry.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.210
In the Kubernetes
manifest file that

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:42.010
was generated from
my application,

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:45.100
I have a stateful set, with
Hipster Shop's Legacy CRM

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:47.750
container image specified
